title: "The State of AI in Genomics & Precision Medicine - 2026"
message: >-
  If you use this dataset or analysis, please cite it using the metadata below.
type: dataset
authors:
  - name: K-Dense Science Lab
    website: https://kdense.science
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-09-27"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - genomics
  - precision-medicine
  - health-ai
  - market-research
  - OpenAlex
abstract: >-
  A reproducible market analysis of 19,600 OpenAlex-indexed works whose
  title/abstract references artificial intelligence, machine learning, or
  deep learning AND genomics/genome/precision medicine (snapshot
  2026-09-26; 19,532 non-paratext works analyzed through 2023, plus fresh
  server-side strict-pairing trend counts through 2026 YTD). Includes the
  raw extract (JSONL), a flattened CSV, computed statistics, a deterministic
  zero-dependency Python pipeline, an independent QA script, and four
  publication-grade figures.
